            "review_title": "Review at Ofukuro-tei",
            "review_text": "minh Nt\nHanoi, Vietnam156 contributions\n0\nvery good family style food joint\nApr 2019 • Friends\nThis Ofukuro-tei has been there quite some time and close to the socalled Japaness neighbourhoods. It's on the 1st Fl of the VTower, the first Japanese boring grey colored building in Hanoi. though it uses Kim Ma str address butvthe entrance is in the back fronting Đê La Thành str.\n\nThe space is not large, very simple decors, lots of old books or magazines in Japanese language.\n\nit's quite crownded with many local Japanese folks come for regular lunch or dinner.\n\nthe menu is quite extensive. foods are fresh and taste more Japanese authentic flavors.\n\nStaffs are friendly. prices are mid-range\nRead more\nWritten April 29, 2019",
