            "review_text": "UyenVuong\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nStaff are superb\nOct 2017 • Solo\nStaff here are so nice and of great help. I was parking outside the restaurant as I did not know where to park. And when a waiter here knew, he offered to park it for me as I was going alone. I ordered unagi sushi and kaisendon. The unagi sushi was served without the sauce by mistake. I didnt pay attention to it and had eaten a piece. Then the waiter found out about the missing sauce and he offered a whole new set. I was very surprise and please about both the food and the service. Definitely come back!\nRead more\nWritten October 4, 2017",
